    ('Neon OPEN sign with red lettering', 'Look for a classic rectangular or square sign with bright red neon tubes spelling OPEN, often found above shop doors or windows with that warm glow at night.', 'Identify a neon sign displaying the word ''OPEN'' with bright red glowing tubing forming the letters. The sign must show the complete word in neon.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Neon OPEN signs were specifically designed to remain visible through commercial windows at night because neon''s glow penetrates glass reflections better than other light sources.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/13e481d44d6e5dd5.jpg', 0),
