    ('Hotel neon marquee sign', 'Seek out large horizontal signs with tall vertical letters spelling a hotel name, featuring multiple neon colors and often decorative elements like arrows or geometric patterns.', 'Identify a large neon marquee sign with ''HOTEL'' text or hotel branding in glowing neon tubing. The sign must display prominent horizontal lettering typical of hotel entrances.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Hotel neon signs were often installed on roofs deliberately—airlines used prominent neon marquees as navigation reference points before electronic instruments became standard.', null, 2),
