    ('Vintage neon boot and spur design', 'Look for a neon boot outline with visible spurs, often found on old western-themed bars or saloons, rendered in bold lines with classic red or blue neon tubing.', 'Locate neon tubing forming the silhouette of a cowboy boot with spurs attached. Both the boot and spur details must be visible in the glowing neon design.', 'rare'::public.item_rarity, 'Western-themed boot and spur neon signs dominated rural business districts because neon''s ability to maintain brightness in bright sunlight made them visible across dusty streets.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/28ba0cb0d72f1c18.jpg', 13),
